{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"851856616469823528","content":"?help stocks","created_at":"2021-06-16T20:06:05.265000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"854814109006299156","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"ArcaniaBot","id":"810907841329627137","is_bot":1,"username":"ArcaniaBot"},"author_id":"810907841329627137","channel_id":"851856616469823528","content":"?stocks\n`?stocks (buy|sell|mine) (company_name) (amount)`\n\nAllows buying and selling stocks of companies in Empire City.\n\nTo display today's stock prices, run just `?stocks`.\nTo show how many stocks for each company you own, run `?stocks mine` or `?stocks list`.\nTo buy stocks, run `?stocks buy (company_name) (amount)`.\nTo sell stocks, run `?stocks sell (company_name) (amount)`.\nYou cannot sell more stocks than you own at any given time.\nYou will be told the current unit price for each stock, and the total price you'd gain/lose.\nAfter that message, you will be prompted for confirmation - yes/y if you confirm, no/n if not.\nIf you decline, or don't respond within 10 seconds, the transaction will be canceled.\n\nAlso, all transactions are announced in the designated channel.\nYou can see what others are doing, but they can see what you're doing as well.\n\nDMs can also `?stocks reload` in order to get the new daily prices loaded to the service.","created_at":"2021-06-16T20:06:05.539000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"854814110155931658","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
